- Auth0 setup — run the Auth0 CLI (`auth0 login`, then `auth0 apps create`)
- Multi-factor authentication → [mfa/SKILL.md](./mfa/SKILL.md)
- Multi-tenant B2B / Organizations → [organizations/SKILL.md](./organizations/SKILL.md)
